    reflection: { law: 'Design Tokens', summary: 'Design tokens are the difference between a design system that requires 3 days to update and one that requires 6 weeks. They are the single most impactful foundation investment in any design system.', realWorld: "Salesforce's Lightning Design System was one of the first to document design tokens publicly in 2015. Their ability to support multiple branded themes across Salesforce products is directly enabled by their token architecture.", bestCall: 'B — explain the propagation and dark mode argument.', learnMore: 'Search: "design tokens explained" + "CSS custom properties semantic naming"' },
